a is more than a chant. In the Vedic understanding, specific Sanskrit syllables carry vibrational power (called ","$L19",") that operates both at the level of meaning and at the level of sound itself. The science of mantra is one of the oldest branches of Vedic knowledge — and one that requires no belief to begin. The effects are observable through practice."]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40","$L41","$L42","$L43","$L44"]}],"$L45","$L46","$L47"]}]}]
